The build environment on linux expects an environment variable

	GM_SW_TOOL_PATH=/path/to/build/tools

In this example, the directory tools should contain subdirectories,
or links to their real locations, as follows:

	diana		the diana distribution (contains release, debug, share)
	GCC		gcc 4.7.2 or higher (contains include, lib64)
	extra		the uuid library (contains include/uuid/, lib)
	qt-4.8.5	Qt (contains include, lib)


